        "id": "original_native_leapfrog",
        "formula": "theta=2*asin(sqrt(l2*lambda)/2); phi_n=A*sin(n*theta)/sin(theta); exact original 250ms pressure forward/center/backward finite differences"
      },
      {
        "id": "exact_semidiscrete_velocity_impulse",
        "formula": "theta=dt*(c/h)*sqrt(lambda); phi_n=A*sin(n*theta)/theta, n>=0. Exact harmonic semidiscrete solution to causal velocity jump v0+=A/dt; physical acceleration impulse impulse-area A/dt. Original A fixed; original spatial graph and 8node source weights."
      },
      {
        "id": "exact_semidiscrete_one_sample_force_hold",
        "formula": "theta=dt*(c/h)*sqrt(lambda); acceleration a=A/dt^2 is held constant over [0,dt] and zero thereafter, phi0=0, phi_n=A*[cos((n-1)*theta)-cos(n*theta)]/theta^2 for n>=1. Exact semidiscrete causal force quadrature for original single nonzero q0 sample, same a and original source weights."
      }
    ],
